#Ferry Boat Transport# 
FRTH01 Ferry to Portland, Cost: $800, Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to buy a ticket
FRTH02 Ferry to Staunton, Cost: $800, Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to buy a ticket
FRTH03 Ferry to Santa Perraloca, Cost: $800, Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to buy a ticket
FRTH04 Ferry to Los Santos, Cost: $800, Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to buy a ticket
FRTH05 Ferry to Gatork, Cost: $800, Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to buy a ticket
FRTH06 Ferry to Cottonmouth, Cost: $800, Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to buy a ticket
FRTH07 Wait sometime until a both ferry is docked ready to transport.
FRTH08 You need $800 for a ferry ticket, Come back when you have enough money!
FRTH09 Wanted criminals are not allowed on the ferry!
FRTH10 You can't use a ferry whilst on a mission
FRTH11 Your vehicle won't fit on the ferry!
FRTH12 Hold Press ~k~~PED_SPRINT~ to skip to the end of the Ferry

